  "objects": [
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-1",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 28,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "操作说明 · 全工具指南",
      "fontSize": 32
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-2",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 90,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 290,
      "zIndex": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "1.1.2：自订工具列新增「图示风格」，可选原本描边或A彩色双色描边，保存後一般画布、屏幕画布及轮盘共用并保留设定；取消不应用，恢复默认回到原本描边。屏幕模式图示共用同一窗框，旁边的鼠标代表操作、画笔代表作画；轮盘显示可切换的目标模式。藤条维持原有直藤条造型，实际画笔／雷射颜色仍由选用工具下方色线显示。 A彩色图示使用细描边；钢笔与萤光笔的笔身会随目前笔刷颜色更新，只有目前工具显示底部色线。直线、箭头与其他形状使用紫色识别；原本描边的选择也显示范围框与鼠标。 左右停靠时改用窄单栏。图文模式从目前分页名称切换分页，箭头切换同组工具。六个快捷色移到笔刷下方。 从自订工具列选小、中或大。按钮、图示与快色会一起调整，图文模式的文字也会跟着调整。 新安装与还原默认采彩色图示，已保存的图示选择会继续沿用。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-3",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 392,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 260,
      "zIndex": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "01 介面与手册语言 · 02 开始使用 · 03 首页与作品库 · 04 画布格式与页面 · 05 平移、缩放与视角锁定 · 06 导览与工具列 · 07 右键工具轮盘 · 08 画笔与笔刷 · 09 线段、箭头、形状与曲线 · 10 选择与物件变形 · 11 属性、色彩与样式 · 12 文字与便条纸 · 13 橡皮擦 · 14 尺规 · 15 圆规：准备、锁定、画弧 · 16 教学提醒：雷射与藤条 · 17 计算机与计时器 · 18 图片、截图与裁切 · 19 图钉与配色 · 20 屏幕画布 · 21 保存、数据与导出 · 22 快捷键速查 · 23 程序更新 · 24 功能范围与已知限制 · 25 背景设定操作要点 · 26 图层顺序与操作回馈",
      "fontSize": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-4",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 720,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 3,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "01 · 介面与手册语言",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-5",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 782,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 4,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "首页侧栏下方「语言」（收合时为文/A图示）提供繁体中文（默认）、简体中文、英文、日文、韩文、西班牙文、法文、德文、葡萄牙文（巴西）、阿拉伯文。保存成功立即应用，下次启动沿用。既有作品名称与文字不翻译，新建的默认名称采当时语言。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-6",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 904,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 5,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "使用说明随目前介面语言开启；本页语言选单只切换手册，不改程序偏好。全部手册、章节与搜寻均可离线使用。阿拉伯文介面与手册从右向左阅读，画布座标不镜像。系统选档与原始错误讯息可能使用其他语言，部分内建控制项可能需重新启动。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-7",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1082,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 6,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "02 · 开始使用",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-8",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1144,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 7,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "首页按＋新增，选笔记本、无边界画布或有边界黑板，输入名称并设定背景色与样式。画笔用来手写，选择工具（V）用来移动及调整物件。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-9",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1236,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 8,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "自动存档默认关闭。Ctrl+S可手动保存，离开作品或正常退出也会保存。导出.heiban可作为可编辑备份。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-10",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1384,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 9,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "03 · 首页与作品库",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-11",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1446,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 10,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "单击卡片只反白，不显示批次操作列；双击或右键「开启作品」进入。右键亦可收藏、改名、副本与移到垃圾桶。垃圾桶保留原稿，双击垃圾桶卡片可还原。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-12",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1538,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 230,
      "zIndex": 11,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "按导入旁虚线圆进入多选，圆圈打勾表示已选；可全选目前结果或逐张选择，再移到垃圾桶，「完成」离开多选。可搜寻名称、筛选格式、依修改／建立／名称排序及选160／190／250 pt缩图。导入支援.heiban／.blackboard.json；侧栏切换全部、收藏与垃圾桶。 工具列默认为「图示与文字」，常用分页预先包含笔刷与线条样式；可在自订工具列调整。首次使用会加入「操作说明 · 全工具指南」无边界笔记，涵盖全部工具及可编辑范例。用中键拖曳／空白键加拖曳平移，滚轮缩放，开图钉清单可跳到各章。旧范例与已编辑作品不会被覆写；修改或删除新指南後不会每次重建。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-13",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1780,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 12,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "垃圾桶作品保留 30 天，卡片显示期限。到期作品会在开启程序或重新整理作品库时清除。升级前已在垃圾桶的作品从首次开启新版起保留 30 天。双击可还原，也可在右键或 ⋯ 选单选择「还原」或「永久删除」。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-14",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1958,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 13,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "04 · 画布格式与页面",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-15",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2020,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 14,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "笔记本各页独立，底部页码与左右箭头翻页，＋新增页；页码选单可跳页、改名、副本、排序及删页。无边界画布可向任意方向延伸。有边界黑板提供固定纸张边界，适合简报与排版。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-16",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2112,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 15,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "无边界不显示尺寸。新有边界黑板首次默认16:9简报（1920×1080），仍可改A4直向、A4横向或1:1；切换格式记住此对话框已选尺寸。新增与画布背景提供空白、横线、点状、方格、五线谱及底色；既有作品按应用才修改，取消保留，修改可单步撤销。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-17",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2290,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 16,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "05 · 平移、缩放与视角锁定",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-18",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2352,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 17,
      "strokeColor": "#57816c",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "锁定视角",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-19",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2414,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 18,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "滚轮以鼠标位置缩放，Ctrl+滚轮亦同；水平滚轮平移，中键拖曳或空白键加左键拖曳平移。阅读模式左键拖曳平移；倍率控制提供默认比例、适合内容及重设视角。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-20",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2506,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 19,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "视角锁定停止平移与滚轮缩放，避免讲解误移。工具列与角落的锁定指示同步变化，解锁後可再次移动视野。 按住中键平移时，游标会显示握住画布的手形；放开恢撤销游标。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-21",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2654,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 20,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "06 · 导览与工具列",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-22",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2716,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 21,
      "strokeColor": "#57816c",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "停靠位置",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-23",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2778,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 22,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "上方导览包含首页、阅读／编辑、图钉、＋插入、更多、存档状态及固定开关；未固定时鼠标离开会收合。勾号表示已存，虚线圆表示待存、保存中或尚未完成。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-24",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2870,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 23,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "拖工具列握把到四边，上下横排、左右直排。更多→自订工具列可显示、隐藏与排序，隐藏的项目仍在更多工具。「物件图层」有工具列入口与独立面板；屏幕工具列不显示卷轴。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-25",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2962,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 170,
      "zIndex": 24,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "首页设定或「更多 → 自订工具列」可选只有图示，或图示与文字分页。图文模式分成常用、绘图、插入、管理；选择（V）固定常驻。工具只排一行／一列，空间不足用两端箭头切换工具组，不增加工具排数。自订窗口左侧勾选显示，另勾「常用」挑选常用分页；仍可全选、默认及排序。所有应用程序内面板与对话框固定使用黑板的纸白／绿色设计，不随 Windows 亮暗主题切换；系统档案挑选器由 Windows 管理。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-26",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3144,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 260,
      "zIndex": 25,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "工具列默认为「图示与文字」，常用分页预先包含笔刷与线条样式；可在自订工具列调整。首次使用会加入「操作说明 · 全工具指南」无边界笔记，涵盖全部工具及可编辑范例。用中键拖曳／空白键加拖曳平移，滚轮缩放，开图钉清单可跳到各章。旧范例与已编辑作品不会被覆写；修改或删除新指南後不会每次重建。 「清除本页」默认收在常用；更新时只追加这一项，保留其他自订常用。一般画布与屏幕画布的图形选单使用相同描边图示与九宫格。 选择与雷射固定显示於所有分页外，雷射默认纳入常用但不重复一颗按钮；再次点雷射开启设定。 画笔与橡皮擦以笔尖／接触点定位；图形工具恢复十字落点与旁边的工具图示；选择保留箭头，中键平移与缩放／旋转控制点保留对应游标。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-27",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3416,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 26,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "1.1.0：更多选单改用统一的绿色描边图示。屏幕画布自订工具列可「应用」即时预览，或保存後关闭；取消只放弃尚未应用的修改。它只调整屏幕支援的工具，保留一般画布的图钉、视角锁定及其他自订设定。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-28",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3538,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 290,
      "zIndex": 27,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "1.1.2：自订工具列新增「图示风格」，可选原本描边或A彩色双色描边，保存後一般画布、屏幕画布及轮盘共用并保留设定；取消不应用，恢复默认回到原本描边。屏幕模式图示共用同一窗框，旁边的鼠标代表操作、画笔代表作画；轮盘显示可切换的目标模式。藤条维持原有直藤条造型，实际画笔／雷射颜色仍由选用工具下方色线显示。 A彩色图示使用细描边；钢笔与萤光笔的笔身会随目前笔刷颜色更新，只有目前工具显示底部色线。直线、箭头与其他形状使用紫色识别；原本描边的选择也显示范围框与鼠标。 左右停靠时改用窄单栏。图文模式从目前分页名称切换分页，箭头切换同组工具。六个快捷色移到笔刷下方。 从自订工具列选小、中或大。按钮、图示与快色会一起调整，图文模式的文字也会跟着调整。 新安装与还原默认采彩色图示，已保存的图示选择会继续沿用。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-29",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3896,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 28,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "07 · 右键工具轮盘",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-30",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3958,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 29,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "先放开左键，再按住右键约0.22秒；向工具格移动，亮起且图示放大後放开右键切换。快速向外拨选也可开启轮盘；回到中心或按Esc取消。切换工具时，各格保留原本配置。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-31",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4050,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 30,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "更多→右键工具轮盘：将上方工具列图示拖到圆盘格内，或用旁边选单配置直线、箭头、形状等工具；拖到已有相同工具时交换位置。一般画布与屏幕画布分别保存，屏幕固定保留操作格。新设定在空闲时保存，正常退出会等待保存完成。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-32",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4172,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 31,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "屏幕画布作画时可右键双击，或用轮盘的操作格，切换成操作穿透；按Ctrl+Alt+D恢复作画。短右键仍保留物件选单，屏幕版会先等待系统双击判定；雷射与藤条短右键不选物件。连用轮盘不算双击操作。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-33",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4294,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 32,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "更多→设定工具轮盘可选择默认配置，再拖工具到格子自订；一般画布与屏幕画布各自保存。应用新配置前先完成目前笔画。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-34",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4386,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 140,
      "zIndex": 33,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "屏幕画布的操作模式也可按住右键叫出轮盘；短按会交还原软体，长按选工具後放开会切回作画，固定的「作画」格可恢撤销绘图工具。Esc取消。快速开始的右键拖曳优先交还原软体；若特定程序本身使用右键长按，可在更多关闭「操作模式右键轮盘」。较高权限程序与安全桌面不拦截。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-35",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4594,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 34,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "08 · 画笔与笔刷",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-36",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4656,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 35,
      "strokeColor": "#57816c",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "钢笔 · 萤光笔 · 油漆笔刷 · 笔刷与物件设定 · 遮题胶带",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-37",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4718,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 170,
      "zIndex": 36,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "选择钢笔、萤光笔或绘图工具，再点「笔刷」调整颜色、粗细与透明度。先在色轮调色，再按常用色的＋保存；点色票应用，右键可移除，还原默认色可重设。色票可全部删除，重开仍保留；一般与屏幕画布共用此色盘。只有目前选用的绘图工具会在图示下方显示下一笔描边色的色线；笔刷面板使用单一卷动区。没有材质效果的笔刷类型选单已移除，旧作品仍保留原字段。 一般与屏幕画布现在共用笔刷设定：粗细0.5～128 pt、笔画透明度0～100%。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-38",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4900,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 260,
      "zIndex": 37,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "向量笔近似直线，保持按住且停0.5秒可吸附直线，移动超过12 pt恢撤销预览；放开才提交一笔可撤销操作。更多工具的遮题胶带可遮住题目，双击或物件设定揭示／遮住，支援撤销。 钢笔、萤光笔及油漆笔刷完成後不会自动选择或显示框线；按V再点选物件可移动、缩放或旋转，双击才开详细属性。板擦保留左高右低，长边缩短20%，厚度不变。 钢笔、萤光笔、油漆笔与橡皮擦的游标笔尖／接触点就是实际落点，原版与A图示皆适用。雷射的较小光点以中心定位。 笔刷右方提供上三下三的六个圆形快捷色，直接点选切换；顺序等於常用色前六项。笔刷与雷射的常用色票皆为圆形。常用色→管理可拖曳排序，右键移除；变更即保存，两画布共用。少於六色的空圈停用，不会自行补回默认色。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-39",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "stroke",
      "x": 66,
      "y": 5182,
      "width": 610,
      "height": 42,
      "zIndex": 38,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
